sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: Charging Station has log information available

    CSMS->>CS: GetLogRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: GetLogResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploading, requestId = same Id as GetLogRequest from Step 1)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse

    CSMS->>CS: GetLogRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: GetLogResponse (status = AcceptedCanceled)

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = AcceptedCanceled, requestId = same Id as GetLogRequest from Step 1)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploading, requestId = same Id as GetLogRequest from Step 5)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploaded, requestId = same Id as GetLogRequest from Step 5)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse
